

<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="card border-0 shadow-lg rounded-4 text-center p-4 p-md-5">
        <h1 class="display-3 fw-bold mb-3">Welcome to ToDoListApp</h1>

        <p class="lead text-muted mx-auto mb-4" style="max-width: 720px;">
            Organize your tasks, manage deadlines, and track your progress effortlessly.
            Our app helps you stay productive and focused every day.
        </p>

        <div class="mb-5">
            <a asp-controller="Task" asp-action="Index"
               class="btn btn-lg text-white px-4 shadow-sm"
               style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #7c3aed);">
                View Your Tasks
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="mx-auto text-secondary" style="max-width: 780px;">
            <p>
                <strong class="text-dark">Why use ToDoListApp?</strong>
                Because keeping track of your daily tasks shouldn't be a hassle.
                With our clean and simple interface, you can add, edit, and delete tasks with ease.
            </p>

            <p>
                <strong class="text-dark">Stay on top of deadlines:</strong>
                The app highlights urgent tasks so you never miss important deadlines.
                You can filter by date and quickly see what's due soon.
            </p>

            <p>
                <strong class="text-dark">File attachments:</strong>
                Upload files to your tasks and access them directly from the app.
                Everything is organized in one place for maximum efficiency.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>